Author: Hunter J. Melton [aut, cre],
    Chinmay Vaidya [aut]
Maintainer: Hunter J. Melton <Hunter.J.Melton@dartmouth.edu>
Description: Spatial Immune Receptor Analysis and Processing. A consolidated
    toolkit for long-read spatial immune receptor sequencing. SIRAP takes
    demultiplexed reads from the companion 'RRAD' package and runs an
    end-to-end IgBLAST and pRESTO pipeline to produce AIRR-style
    rearrangement tables with spatial IDs and coordinates. It also provides
    Visium HD barcode mapping, clonal summaries, tree plotting, int64-packed
    DNA primitives, and PAF parsing utilities.
